# Hybrid Chess Engine Architecture — Implementation Plan

## Overview

Replace the single Dart-only AI engine with a **hybrid architecture** that routes to the optimal engine based on difficulty mode:

| Mode | Engine | Runs In | Communication |
|------|--------|---------|---------------|
| Basic / Intermediate | **Sunfish** (JS minimax) | Web Worker / Dart Isolate | postMessage / Isolate.run |
| Advanced / Impossible | **Stockfish WASM** | Web Worker | UCI protocol via postMessage |
| Two Player / Multiplayer | **chess.js** (rules only) | Main thread / Backend | Direct calls / WebSocket |

