## Proposed Changes

### Web Workers (New Files)

#### [NEW] [sunfish_engine.js](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/web/engine/sunfish_engine.js)
Lightweight chess AI engine in JS implementing:
- Board representation (mailbox 10×12)
- Move generation with piece-square tables
- Minimax search with alpha-beta pruning
- Depth 1–5 (suitable for Basic & Intermediate)
- Target response time: **<200ms**

#### [NEW] [sunfish.worker.js](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/web/engine/sunfish.worker.js)
Web Worker wrapper that:
- Listens for `{type:'init'}` and `{type:'search', fen, depth}` messages
- Runs Sunfish search in background thread
- Returns `{type:'bestmove', move}` via postMessage

#### [NEW] [stockfish.worker.js](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/web/engine/stockfish.worker.js)
Web Worker wrapper for Stockfish WASM:
- Loads `stockfish.wasm` lazily on first use
- Communicates via UCI protocol:
  - `uci`, `isready`, `position fen <FEN>`, `go depth <N>`
- Parses `bestmove` from UCI output
- Depth config: Advanced → 10–15, Impossible → 18+
- Target response time: **<500ms**

#### [NEW] [chess_logic.js](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/web/engine/chess_logic.js)
chess.js wrapper for move validation (multiplayer/two-player):
- `validateMove(fen, from, to, promotion)`
- `getGameState(fen)` → check/checkmate/stalemate/draw
- [getLegalMoves(fen, square)](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/chess_engine.dart#276-280) → array of legal moves
- No AI computation

#### [NEW] [engine_service.js](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/web/engine/engine_service.js)
Unified façade exposed to Flutter via `window.ChessEngineService`:
- `initEngine(mode, difficulty)` — spins up the right worker
- [getBestMove(fen)](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/ai_engine.dart#25-42) → Promise\<string\>
- `validateMove(fen, from, to, promotion)` → Promise\<bool\>
- [dispose()](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/data/services/multiplayer_service.dart#166-170) — terminates workers
- Internally routes: Sunfish for basic/intermediate, Stockfish for advanced/impossible, chess.js for multiplayer

