### Flutter Integration (New Files)

#### [NEW] [engine_controller.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/engine_controller.dart)
Platform-aware engine controller:
- On **web**: calls `window.ChessEngineService` via `dart:js_interop`
- On **mobile**: delegates to existing [AIEngine](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/ai_engine.dart#6-197) (Dart isolate)
- Unified API:
  - `Future<void> init(GameMode mode, AIDifficulty? difficulty)`
  - `Future<String?> getBestMove(String fen)`
  - `Future<bool> validateMove(String fen, String from, String to, String? promo)`
  - `void dispose()`
- Timeout fallback: 5s for Sunfish, 10s for Stockfish

#### [NEW] [js_engine_bridge.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/js_engine_bridge.dart)
Web-only file using `dart:js_interop` to call `window.ChessEngineService` methods.

#### [NEW] [native_engine_bridge.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/native_engine_bridge.dart)
Mobile-only stub that falls back to the existing `AIEngine.getBestMove()` on Dart isolates.

