## Performance Optimizations

1. **Lazy loading**: Stockfish WASM only loaded when Advanced/Impossible is selected
2. **Worker caching**: Workers persist across moves, only terminated on [dispose()](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/data/services/multiplayer_service.dart#166-170)
3. **Debounce**: Ignore duplicate move requests within 100ms
4. **Background threads**: All computation off main thread (Workers on web, Isolates on mobile)
5. **Opening book**: Sunfish checks opening book before search (instant response)

