## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Stockfish WASM binary**: The Stockfish WASM file (~2MB) needs to be downloaded from the official repo and placed in `web/engine/`. This is a one-time setup.

> [!WARNING]
> **Mobile Stockfish**: On mobile (Android/iOS), Stockfish requires native binary compilation via FFI. For now, Advanced/Impossible on mobile will use the existing Dart AI at deeper depths (8–10). Full native Stockfish integration can be added later as a separate task.

